DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Corey O’Brien\nCorey O’B
	rien is a rising stand-up comedian known for his energetic delivery\, shar
	p wit\, and fearlessly honest material. His comedy draws from personal exp
	eriences and cultural observations\, delivered with a confident\, engaging
	 style that keeps audiences laughing throughout. \nThe Red Tour is his lat
	est stand-up tour\, featuring fresh material and the high-energy performan
	ce style that has earned him a growing fanbase across the country. Fans ca
	n expect a polished\, entertaining set full of clever comedy and genuine l
	aughs. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, July 8\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Do
	ors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress:
	 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage
	 Minimum \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Comedy Club Sacramento is Northern 
	California’s premier comedy destination. Located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacr
	amento\, this legendary club has been the go-to spot for world-class stand
	-up comedy for decades. \nThe intimate setting features general admission 
	and preferred premium seating\, a full bar\, and a classic two-drink minim
	um. The room holds a few hundred guests\, making every show feel personal 
	and electric. Ample parking is available in the adjacent shopping center. 
	\nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo headline performance of Corey O’Brien’s R
	ed Tour. Additional shows are available July 8–9\, so check for your prefe
	rred time. Expect a high-energy\, laugh-packed evening of stand-up comedy.
	 Shows run approximately 75–90 minutes. \nTicket Information\nTickets rang
	e from approximately $27 – $65 (all-in pricing\, fees included before taxe
	s). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links.
	 We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalend
	ar.com/event/corey-obrien-the-red-tour-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacr
	amento/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
