DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nLiz Miele LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club\nGet read
	y for a night of sharp\, witty\, and deeply relatable comedy as Liz Miele 
	takes the stage at the legendary Punch Line Comedy Club in San Francisco. 
	Known for her fearless storytelling and razor-sharp observations\, Liz del
	ivers a stand-up experience that will have you laughing from start to fini
	sh. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, July 8\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM (Doors
	 open at 7:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco\nAddress:
	 444 Battery Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94111\nAge Requirement: 18+ with 
	valid government-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2-item minimum per per
	son \nAbout Liz Miele\nLiz Miele is a New York-based stand-up comedian kno
	wn for her honest\, self-deprecating humor and energetic stage presence. S
	he has appeared on Comedy Central\, AXS TV\, and released multiple acclaim
	ed comedy specials. Her material covers everything from anxiety and relati
	onships to the absurdities of everyday life\, earning her a devoted fanbas
	e across the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from
	 one of the sharpest voices in the game\nHilarious takes on modern life\, 
	relationships\, and personal quirks\nAn intimate club setting perfect for 
	a great night out\nFull bar and food service available throughout the show
	\nGeneral admission seating — arrive early for the best spots\nA memorable
	 evening of laughs in one of SF’s most iconic comedy venues\n\nVenue Infor
	mation\nPunch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco is one of the most storied 
	comedy clubs in the country\, located in the heart of the Financial Distri
	ct at 444 Battery Street. The intimate setting ensures every seat is a gre
	at seat\, with a full bar and food service to enhance your experience. \nT
	icket Information\nTickets start at approximately $42 and go up to $132 de
	pending on availability. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (offic
	ial) or VividSeats (resale). All sales are final — no refunds or exchanges
	 unless the event is cancelled. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis 
	post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase ticket
	s through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show t
	imes subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps
	://comedycalendar.com/event/liz-miele-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club/\n\nF
	rom Comedy Calendar
