DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at
	 no extra cost to you. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nStamptown at The
	 Bell House\nNEW YORK TIMES TOP COMEDY PICK (2022). Stamptown is back at T
	he Bell House! A raunchy\, chaotic\, and full-on fringe experience\, Stamp
	town is a late-night variety show featuring the best alternative performan
	ce from around the world. Hosted by the bad boy of clown\, Zach Zucker\, t
	his show has sold out runs and packed rooms at Netflix Is A Joke\, Just Fo
	r Laughs\, Glastonbury\, Edinburgh Fringe\, Soho Theatre\, Melbourne Inter
	national Comedy Festival\, and off-Broadway in NYC. \nEvent Details\n\nDat
	e: Wednesday\, July 8\, 2026\nDoor Time: 7:00 PM | Show Time: 8:00 PM\nVen
	ue: The Bell House\, 149 7th Street\, Brooklyn\, NY 11215\nAge Requirement
	: 21+ with valid government-issued photo ID\nSeating:\n\nAbout Stamptown\n
	Stamptown is the brainchild of comedian and clown Zach Zucker. It’s a wild
	\, unpredictable variety show that brings together the best alternative co
	medians\, clowns\, and performers from around the globe. Every show is dif
	ferent\, every show is unforgettable. \nWhat to Expect\nA late-night comed
	y extravaganza featuring multiple performers\, physical comedy\, clowning\
	, and pure chaos. This is not your average stand-up show — Stamptown is an
	 experience. \nVenue Information\nThe Bell House149 7th Street\, Brooklyn\
	, NY 11215By Subway: Take the F\, G or R Train to the Smith-9th Streets st
	ation. \nTicket Information\nTickets are $30.75 (all-inclusive pricing). T
	here is an 8-ticket limit per order. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nDi
	sclaimer: This post contains affiliate links. Purchasing tickets through o
	ur links helps support this site at no additional cost to you.\n\nhttps://
	comedycalendar.com/event/stamptown-live-at-the-bell-house-2/\n\nFrom Comed
	y Calendar
