DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nNate Jackson Big Dog Tour LIVE at Blue Note Hawaii
	 (Thursday Early Show)\nNate Jackson\, one of the fastest-rising stars in 
	stand-up comedy\, brings his electrifying Big Dog Tour to the intimate Blu
	e Note Hawaii in Honolulu. With over 4.5 million TikTok followers and 700 
	million global views\, Jackson delivers sharp crowd work and fearless come
	dy that leaves audiences in stitches. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, Ju
	ly 9\, 2026\nTime: 6:30 PM (Early Show)\nVenue: Blue Note Hawaii\nAddress:
	 2335 Kalakaua Ave\, Honolulu\, HI 96815\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Valid phot
	o ID required)\nFood/Beverage Minimum: $20 per person\nSeating: Communal &
	 First Come\, First Served \nAbout Nate Jackson\nNate Jackson is a viral c
	omedy sensation with over 4.5 million TikTok followers and 700 million glo
	bal views. In 2025\, he released his first one-hour Netflix special\, Nate
	 Jackson: Super Funny\, which premiered at #3 on the Netflix Top 10. He is
	 currently shooting season 2 of Apple’s Bad Monkey and recently appeared a
	longside Keanu Reeves\, Seth Rogen\, and Keke Palmer in Aziz Ansari’s Good
	 Fortune. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from a Netflix-f
	eatured headliner\nSharp crowd work and fearless\, taboo-busting material\
	nHosted by Trenton Cotten\, featuring Pepper Lamb\nIntimate club setting w
	ith full bar and dinner menu\nAn unforgettable night of laughs in Waikiki\
	n\nVenue Information\nBlue Note Hawaii is Honolulu’s premier jazz and come
	dy club\, located at 2335 Kalakaua Ave in the heart of Waikiki. The venue 
	offers a full bar\, dinner menu\, and an intimate atmosphere perfect for l
	ive performances. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $40.51 – $63.09
	. A $20 food or beverage minimum per person applies. No refunds or exchang
	es. All sales are final. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post co
	ntains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets throu
	gh our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times su
	bject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://come
	dycalendar.com/event/nate-jackson-big-dog-tour-live-at-blue-note-hawaii-th
	ursday/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nate-jackson-big-dog-tour-live-at-blue
	-note-hawaii-thursday/
LOCATION:Blue Note Hawaii\, 2335 Kalakaua Avenue\, Honolulu\, HI\, 96815\, 
	United States
