SUMMARY:Pete Holmes: Pete Here Now LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club Sacrament
	o
DTSTAMP:20260709T045830Z
DTSTART:20260709T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Pete Holmes\nPete Holmes
	 is one of comedy’s most beloved performers — a comedian\, actor\, writer\
	, and podcaster known for his HBO semi-autobiographical series “Crashing\,
	” his long-running podcast “You Made It Weird\,” and multiple acclaimed st
	and-up specials including “Faces and Sounds” and “Dirty Clean.” \nHis come
	dy is warm\, philosophical\, and deeply funny\, blending personal storytel
	ling with big ideas about life\, spirituality\, and human connection. “Pet
	e Here Now” is his latest tour\, promising a fresh hour of material that s
	howcases Pete at his most present and hilarious. \nEvent Details\nDate: Th
	ursday\, July 9\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Punc
	h Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA
	 95825\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum \nAbout the Venue\nPunch
	 Line Comedy Club Sacramento is the crown jewel of Northern California’s c
	omedy scene. Located at 2100 Arden Way\, this storied venue has welcomed t
	he biggest names in stand-up for decades. The intimate club-style layout e
	nsures an up-close\, personal experience with the performer. \nThe full ba
	r\, two-drink minimum\, and warm atmosphere make for a classic comedy nigh
	t out. Additional shows are available July 10–11\, so there are plenty of 
	options to catch Pete Holmes live. Parking is available in the surrounding
	 shopping center lot. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo headline performanc
	e of Pete Holmes’ “Pete Here Now” tour. Expect a warm\, funny\, and though
	t-provoking evening of stand-up comedy from one of the genre’s most unique
	 voices. Shows run approximately 75–90 minutes. \nTicket Information\nTick
	ets range from approximately $44 – $80 (all-in pricing\, fees included bef
	ore taxes). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliat
	e links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://come
	dycalendar.com/event/pete-holmes-pete-here-now-live-at-punch-line-comedy-c
	lub-sacramento/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
