	Address: 309 Curtis Mathes Way #147\, Arlington\, TX 76018\nAge Requiremen
	t: 18+ \nAbout Luenell\nLuenell is a stand-up comedian and actress best kn
	own for her scene-stealing roles in Borat: Cultural Learnings of America f
	or Make Benefit Glorious Nation of Kazakhstan\, A Star Is Born (2018)\, an
	d the Hotel Transylvania franchise. She has appeared on Chelsea Lately\, T
	he Tonight Show\, and numerous other TV programs. Her raw\, unfiltered com
	edy style has made her a fan favorite across the country. \nWhat to Expect
	\n\nHilarious\, no-holds-barred stand-up comedy from a Hollywood fan favor
	ite\nOutrageous storytelling and crowd interaction\nAn intimate comedy clu
	b experience at Arlington Improv\nA night packed with non-stop laughs\nFul
	l bar service available\n\nVenue Information\nArlington Improv is located 
	at 309 Curtis Mathes Way #147 in Arlington\, TX\, conveniently situated in
	 the Dallas-Fort Worth metroplex. This premier comedy club offers an intim
	ate setting with full bar service and is one of the top comedy destination
	s in the DFW area. \nTicket Information\nTickets are available now through
	 Ticketmaster. This is an 18+ event. Grab your seats before they sell out 
