	ckets\nResale Tickets \nCorey O’Brien: The Red Tour LIVE at Cobb’s Comedy 
	Club\nRising stand-up comedian Corey O’Brien brings his highly anticipated
	 The Red Tour to San Francisco’s legendary Cobb’s Comedy Club on Thursday\
	, July 9\, 2026. Known for his sharp wit\, relatable storytelling\, and in
	fectious energy\, Corey O’Brien is one of the most exciting voices in come
	dy today. Don’t miss this unforgettable night of laughs in the heart of Sa
	n Francisco. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 9\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 P
	M (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 915 Columbu
	s Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Valid photo ID 
	required)\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per person\nParking: Street parki
	ng available\; garages nearby \nAbout Corey O’Brien\nCorey O’Brien is a fa
	st-rising stand-up comedian celebrated for his clever observations\, self-
	deprecating humor\, and high-energy performances. With a growing fanbase b
	uilt through social media and live touring\, Corey has established himself
	 as a must-see act on the comedy circuit. The Red Tour marks a major miles
	tone in his career\, bringing his best material to audiences across the co
	untry. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA full evening of original stand-up comedy from
	 Corey O’Brien\nSharp\, relatable humor covering everyday life and modern 
	absurdities\nAn intimate club setting at one of SF’s most iconic comedy ve
	nues\nHigh-energy performance with crowd interaction\nSpecial opening act 
	to warm up the crowd\nA night you’ll be talking about long after the show\
	n\nVenue Information\nCobb’s Comedy Club\, located at 915 Columbus Avenue 
	in San Francisco’s North Beach neighborhood\, is one of the premier comedy
	 clubs on the West Coast. With a capacity of around 400\, it offers an int
	imate yet electric atmosphere perfect for live stand-up comedy. The club f
	eatures full bar service and a two-beverage minimum per guest. \nTicket In
	formation\nTickets start at $38.20 for General Admission. This is an 18+ e
	vent — valid photo ID is required for entry. Tickets are available through
	 Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale marketplace). \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a comm
