SUMMARY:Chico Bean LIVE at Pittsburgh Improv
DTSTAMP:20260709T045830Z
DTSTART:20260710T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Chico Bean\nChico Bean i
	s one of the most electrifying comedians in the game today\, best known as
	 a fan favorite on Nick Cannon’s Wild ‘N Out on MTV. \nBorn in Washington 
	D.C.\, Chico Bean has been performing stand-up since his teens and has bui
	lt a massive following through his sharp wit\, freestyle rap battles\, and
	 hilarious crowd work. His energy on stage is unmatched — every show is a 
	unique\, high-octane experience. \nBeyond Wild ‘N Out\, Chico Bean has tou
	red extensively across the country and released stand-up content that has 
	racked up millions of views online. He is one of the most in-demand live c
	omedy performers working today. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 10\, 
	2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Pittsburgh Improv\, 16
	6 E. Bridge St\, Homestead\, PA 15120\nAge Restriction: 21+ Event\nShow Du
	ration: Approximately 90 minutes \nAbout the Venue\nThe Pittsburgh Improv 
	is Pittsburgh’s premier comedy club\, located in the Waterfront entertainm
	ent complex in Homestead\, PA — just minutes from downtown Pittsburgh. \nT
	he intimate showroom seats approximately 300 guests with excellent sightli
	nes from every seat. A full-service bar and restaurant are on-site\, with 
	a two-drink minimum per person. \nFree parking is available throughout the
	 Waterfront complex. Easily accessible via I-376 and Route 837. Arrive ear
	ly to enjoy dinner before the show. \nWhat to Expect\nChico Bean’s live sh
	ow is a non-stop comedy experience — expect rapid-fire jokes\, crowd inter
	action\, freestyle moments\, and a performance that keeps you on the edge 
	of your seat. \nHis ability to connect with audiences and turn any moment 
	into comedy gold is what sets him apart. This is a must-see show for fans 
	of Wild ‘N Out and anyone who loves high-energy stand-up. \nThe Pittsburgh
	 Improv typically features a local opener before the headliner takes the s
	tage. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from $25 – $60 depending on seat
	ing and availability. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contain
	s affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nht
	tps://comedycalendar.com/event/chico-bean-live-at-pittsburgh-improv/\n\nFr
	om Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/chico-bean-live-at-pittsburgh-improv/
LOCATION:Pittsburgh Improv\, 166 E. Bridge St\, Homestead\, Pennsylvania\, 
	15120\, United States
